  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "望幸不到，文章未就。三子逐兔，犬踦不得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bc80e9fc74bf0ef22524f6d4b24989ffe771686deca0f2ce699f9dcc1e19dd9b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2c42996538dfca390df38e6599268b5cf6d759ced42f8196a7b788200fff804f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "焱風阻越，車馳竭竭。棄名追亡，失其和節。憂心惙惙。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b013f44a8a2132ab7d68817c50325680aab35bb7e10c687550dbe2e65f337525",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:49628bd52b7fe787f0d5c003db4bfe1a46ca5edbda2269d4b088527fcead1224"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "蛇得澤草，不憂危殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:72d49605ec2bd33e089d3bd17a14b3611ba311b4aaebbe1e741e2e194258c6e6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b21c04f3534d18e80aa874bdff5d9e81ad594db851a360afe9ba2dc8487bf2d7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "兩犬爭鬥，股瘡無處。不成仇讎，行解卻去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1c9e365235783cc92a456ee7bb43ff9bdf0987e9aae17511e89d6d673f72c156",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4182b0207d82d97182444aa66e926621f08ded2b00dea8852d86b445252e9854"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "因禍受福，喜盈其室，求事皆得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3f937d7b4e15ceb0e8a2b711940a1ed2039c786b406bbec8c66dd4b044450512",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cbbd25c9a979421469472ec67568a17735c136b578cb61cf528ada3591e2511a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "江有寶珠，海多大魚。亟行疾去，可以得財。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:092454e2fd558594ced79fa6db388bf885611e6494ebdf282d150b64f9553e5a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:96af53b462f5d3a4710c85d00916781112b64e93249aac2347cf5e2424642091"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "三年生狗，以戌為母。荊夷上侵，伯姬出走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4e241dfde4af9902a28913286c884bdfb857abfb4cec781e2d50a0618aef19c8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c3d01cc85d3e38db88b66d8788d49337762d8ac0073e5f67c34e193ef0c65726"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "安息康居，異國窮廬。非吾習俗，使伯憂惑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0afaf43338320d555f4af2d42a5fee4f0f2710522208a26ae3ed1125b1ae70b8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:43fc505b6e9effb2dc50b40fe69951b2ca5c5030035b61135c70825890bb4ae4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "行觸天網，馬死車傷。身無聊賴，困窮乏糧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:da86d4f8a7d3b08669cbbde622ed5f660ceb716180f1af3ec254e682ced4bc83",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:189b5247554e1e0daa6ffaed2dccee637dad914c9f09403a6c28f1b1d83928c4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "裸裎逐狐，為人觀笑。牝雞司晨，主母亂門。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c24dc2de900ebe2c808b7a7badd5ced8ecf40ecee32af2ea792f9a4fde0ec5bc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dad0f1c6465349106e201ce98912f2ec58f93f0c718c091f63d0363f94992ba4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "為季求婦，家在東海。水長無船，不見所歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3348cd95765bfe44b0431a4180906db80e53c224cb1df772ca4354146c775ba6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:516a856b1024b87802b2631586216385893ac1cccaa79a5dc4ae272453f24f11"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "男女合室，二姓同食。婚姻孔云，宜我多孫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5b0f0c5e6733af620a661f9ae608b3fe428a288c3a158170031cb58fe84e2404",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:945fbe0811fd9b4a1e6c021b5d1453166e9528046eca74af477f2ed6ee532660"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "天門帝室，黃帝所直。藩屏周衛，不可得入。常安長在，終無禍患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2cf9d94a0161bf39a76a45a108e4ddf59c4b37f9831a7110beb6a3b90820e95d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:366e6b83b0741bff5bdeda737b01b75bb3d0f74397a6df96c2565affaafc3ea4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "齍金觀市，欲置騮子。猾偷竊發，盜我黃寶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2816b406d56837e265c8ff72bac349a70a2a2bafbc604dbe8074c0e8a79676d2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b60d65b8dce7546a511d15da94eda0dbc5595a1cc02fd2dc5714f8bb279c87a7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "三思俱行，欲歸故鄉。望邑入門，拜見家親。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5e6780d33dc87124392fd53fb60e074dbf96241fa455ff4ccda7f26c2ee75b30",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4c6b39135aab75bd949c413fd323e4d9972096975d15076f957c6fbfccf4151d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "娶於姜女，駕迎新婦。少妻在門，夫子悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:38b2a5e55bf0d8500e2ff134908a103fbf95c5760c242587be4bdb0f5f208c00",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a2cd6fbeeccd359cf7029f393bff0ce10f0c94bc93dff61a32682bff2e197fc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "伯仲旅行，南求大牂。孟長痛足，倩季負囊。柳下之貞，不失我邦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:addae306eef6ee6cd9b3223a192215ddded2b25b7c2954ef0b3ea3734837c61c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b9ec693c94cd831ca87326aee592e4849acd6a567fd8c8ec54ea9088b790d376"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "潔身白齒，衰老復起。多孫眾子，宜利姑舅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d7915bc6e5344368cebd0e049878ee6c37700f665fa8e59456a9aec21faeb63c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:913d4deb9b4199414edf725ac81ff2bcddf7161074cc27dfb0acd3779c292b60"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "獨宿深夜，嫫母畏晝。平王逐建，荊子憂懼。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7f22b3c04b1d93131b0506dcf3e06bfd813e29bf2c6966c64c687b4cbcbb4700",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e64bbcd088a3bb74c79bb084c4c1cc311ebf4e764c31a89b8387ce0ce9c6f1fb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "追亡逐北，呼還幼叔。至山而得，復歸其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d1292b5e7ac73d08a4b82d26197ba16abd844830d7d72da91cea2d4070f5251c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ff455a085c6919b261bbab4f7937f957cf9533ca812ebcab8a1e5789690590cf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "鳥飛無翼，兔走折足。雖欲會同，未見其功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9b0a6d62aaa3ed408c709bf8f79dd16eeb669e6be952df1f8c6d8ed5a51175b6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f470b309ecac5efdaac3311a21b6ea1ecf6017169e344c787bc0bda5985b2b7a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "抱空握虛，鴞驚我雛，利出不成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:58850b5ce37296ddd8e44a1af6690c0f5f27050daeaf8c91d953d01032ebb821",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:80f51e85c3fa762dfbecb1dd4daef877a2de6d2758cc354c6a572c5f4a044056"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "山作大池，陸地為海，各得其所。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eb82997477e398b092d47086b50750a77e689b852aa212b104c6d46cf6929323",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2e98823bbd7b5222ca2033245ab2606a400fa7dae67f97ded66e2f4281fa2fd9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "為虎所齧，太山之陽。眾多從者，莫敢救藏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a8fcc77143cc4e5e32d258ffefb108c2b045f813791d00da91bd35d1dee53e45",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:97de27b296fafcaf6ab2c6a0f06f16b544789401ff253ec9879da8f5fa76af5a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "逶迤四牡，思歸念母。王事靡盬，不得安處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aa183293a674d851d6884e5f862b62279d469215c31b32894d877864376e4dae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8d17e783395dc34594869072e08bedba442df56f507a87e71e0b95e3abcfb25f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "獮猴所言，語無成全。誤我白馬，使口不至。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5fc4089079388c0ca47ebdf5678141654424170377a11eeef4f7b5f67dc17e51",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:22062f730fa5abf0656ce7c6500a198656a554233bad9d4752edcc03cc35f6c1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "飛不遠去，卑廝內侍，祿養未富。豐之渙）",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:71a37c40bb49c047feb1c5b5d1b04f176e147be58106b9e7ac72b8179b97f7e9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d6c49e0292fffcb7834ab4b654e7021a21c3e4463085829b3202a73b2ba2b20c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "大尾細腰，重不可搖。陰權制國，平子逐昭。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:373349c9e0d2a5bd5061a125381666506f6b509d59929a14947ce49aa1cc7efe",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:01281beb51753bff464d06fabf7e6ab63e5a5521769e1b77fc26577c58798888"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "旦生夕死，名曰嬰兒，不可得視。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:933cc39b189319b15527d927d04fbadfbbef1577aa0cf8614f57eb95c3207151",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:53c302dbf7ec4cf4174d0b4a9f712440d90173fcd3318bc3b8caba24932a5abe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "子畏於匡，困於陳蔡。明德不危，竟免厄害。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:69509f0acfe7cda654323546312db5b545d436dd374862db45b7cf3bcf59536a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e6941bc94c326bf583a34a866d3ac3a902a9a45042c56d4cf3b9e4f00aa05e98"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "畏昏潛處，候時昭朗。卒逢白日，為世榮主。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:585519182e4b36476eb3ed6996d6b000012474a931b961b6d472ae2620fb0015",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e66a5add132a457da7117bede888d67ab06f7c468f96786f2ade92e668b26f58"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "白鳥御餌，鳴呼其子。旋枝張趐，來從其母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6842532434f110990a98a6612b1c1c4469e074cd264379cd860c8a65d01370eb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a5ecaa4efa6f0d090a06e9804ae1a1149f6e91753820ca9bf869315311968287"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "宮商角徵，五音和氣。君臣父子，弟順有序。唐虞襲德，國無災咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4f67a24d07c7766328f1a177550379d8e2ad19e5bcbe5649f412c04257bb9af3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dd3cf7750dd4368b17f3aec34858e3e2100ccf041452410d496ed40bd9fd6620"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "季姬踟躕，望子城隅。終日至暮，不見齊侯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d7ae350a7d2a7c69d847dff9dc2a87ee0ebb37a641bb8138cfe9a091edd35ec0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3c3bb3a2ac0d3e705bf43564742c99192162950367113326e526c2a70a646b94"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "鬼哭於社，悲傷無後。甲子昧爽，殷人絕祀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:23719d9401f1cd61a00b4cd5a671a1e13f24119fe70fe22366053da54744e94a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:34dc90f7fc0a29bd94bedab9ebc2a21de2852e987d2e9542c061e0d63081b45e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "天之所予，福祿常在，不憂危殆",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cffe683a3cc33332c7c7f8d6cdc6deecc2fb37b92c448a34d4d616023cccfef8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7deaf699e875c11a390697071e095f095720fcaa904f1f710dd41565f3d2d1d6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "比目附翼，相待為福。姜氏季女，與君合德。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0f5fc6f333422febbae2483c48a277e9d89a42edd10ce52a03be579865f93ae8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8b000bc788b7788f38787040eb9982adf226160c48981bf99ead63f485b84e6b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "翕翕軥軥，稍崩墜顛。滅其令名，長沒不全。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1e445f9fe79a798c4e6bb9694b8e4e07d2788f96ed41cb698c965305c679d0ce",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d0d2b71b12e61c381297597b1b82c0ef96c0d6a7f43130e2af657fa853e84fac"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "折芒蔽目，不見雉叔。三足飛鳥，遠去家室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:399df836ba337fabb1fbd6523c526cfe56843f66903989e14c723b5edf0e36ce",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:666fff87e0402a30c79c3b9d7ba6154113b0dedad1367d295889af5bc850b77c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "羊腸九縈，相催稍前。止須王孫，乃能上天。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e70ab0b1bca71458590dc323e95245a94ab217bc802b4650cd67d1ac5e157b10",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:20474d976de31cd3c73fc55f89f3d7520d12fe50d10b79c36060ec58ee47d6e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "坤厚地德，庶物蕃息。平康正直，以綏大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f96e4aff54146704151f7f6e95440be2adb8cc59908ad250d93221851d338562",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:329cd9f632c3b1949448533e3263235ca804b02413ad69cac4829c4a9b827b30"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "有莘外野，不逢堯主。復歸窮處，心勞志苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2d455575dd6b11f87c57756423a3bf858ba12f2eddb3c8089fd8a169fcbe28e5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3e6bc8ce56cdccbd7b952b3df1d3bd5522d92adfebd9968d2502d7fd49a3605e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "咠長景行，來觀柘桑。止伯自喜，都叔允藏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9cd60c908586172d7186eae8609383ecd5bb8a2fc808ba875df45cff04c0acb9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f621702213b623d362a5a1b9231ef292890771b40ce61d448b7792a580b42a1c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "周師伐紂，戰于牧野。甲子平旦，天下喜悅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4a3f2f8579d6dd703826834bd6b0d69a220d6d33809c2af59d80dd6e8095818c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aa35d999ce32e597db74e76ebf8df6933114afadf092b529a5f8ff2f35416298"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "踰江求橘，并得大栗。烹羊食豕，飲食歌笑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9abd7b07837f4f04d509f9855441e15dd0aaed85b8df55979d5de9baf08df4a6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0993ccd3e2a9c6c5e3a48d0a73c80c084e2fa198d6fe17ce8ec5b9f81dad9d44"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "敝笱在梁，魴逸不禁。漁夫勞苦，口燋喉乾。虛空無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:95cf0a2d860e378270914c3054969aaf0ed6798f510acebcb6ec618aa00d9397",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8a10a6653e0c04cd32d0ad976e22a7e1af06a3ce837cac4407d72294604d883b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "生有陰孽，制家非陽。遂受還作，張氏易休。憂禍重凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0fced89bb48ebdc3610c886ee188a940072dd43732f3f1bd5089fed393d285ac",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cbfac981e16d6a9c325c9343ad9f619739c049ad6db66f35a6ce2eeb99d69359"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "絕域異路，多有怪惡。使我驚懼，思我故處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6ea2ce8db9b942516e25c1d45672514e380b48384353bf77dcdfc4652edfd71b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf65d962d3b67135c7b7a903e9c0c721862a2de58aec58e16915fe91a52aeb95"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "迷行失道，不得馬牛。伯賈逃亡，市沒無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6ffb82b1bc77744f6837d3db170c8e5514f20b9cf3606ea3f7568290a7b1dfeb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:49840931efb591423f58f856e52c426be8c5648298adce22aa302c243217a8be"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "雌鸑生鵰，神異興起。乘雲龍騰，民戴為父。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7fa7cfab23eefd19fc618e6a0d08571804dc4fbb05c738423c0b3a85e3d719a1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9b03966e70d7e79c4823744f7acbfec54801d95acab1551317b23b24a2d3bc6f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "疊疊纍纍，如岐之室。畜一息十，古公治邑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1ba44afa90471217a17abe6e8f7f81b9b4d415e531238ac51bde85a8aaeea38c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:db84ea0e44393706b707e077b2464739c35649a18089e135e2f7072290c2b33a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "瘡瘍疥瘙，孝婦不省。君多疣贅，四時作災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ec187c76720898364210d02be1b54c7b805a1583a09954a19a1647ce170e648d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9ae0a8016a169ade50d6cd4cb328f0a355f15babde75aaea687f96f5a724900f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "羊頭兔足，羸瘦少肉。漏囊敗粟，利無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f550f62f6837d04a6e7a0d680e19824d169007ef94819d148a3e7ae8e1de74b5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3650a12949dcd6a29ab982b59ccec206e2fb23e18696758424d619d3958c4211"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "孽蔑徙靡，空無誰是。言季不明，樂減少解。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9e1d44d16cc671900cddd80eecdece68abb3d9b8383ccb44ffe4528c5bf66aa8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:97b3c2bc7c8e5c69cf68f254193f57d87db9684f126e93ecbcc2a722e214f89e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "妹貌親熟，敗君正色。作事不成，自為心賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6f7cbc0f41ff8121549161253def2fed06b956a2a2957ec09de22856c984cb92",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5a329ced6b089be2aeffec1b3473de84dedf7e833e1ee020ecdfb8fe954dbeaa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "四馬共轅，東上太山。騂驪同力，無有重艱。與君笑言。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d018fd4445ca29c7f6c501eecf4c5606f576f0e4c51bb314f231f95784ea54d7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8b27a5de1130c202045b89af7f50eef62fdaa35c9e67f66c7a1c6d9cab99df73"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "陰變為陽，女化為男。治道得通，君臣相衛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:011820e0bea33562575d851b2c2da704e2ae253c23ca085de9629697f988c3ab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f4ac7405c738e736b61b676ae755519f920ff0189c9da603f60c2f4909ac585d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "南國少子，才略美好。求我長女，賤薄不與。反得醜惡，後乃大悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c2ad8e6b74f89d7a16f766c0f0e6f7f014ea2551e35760899fdfeed48b81fe91",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9c4d8488261a4bce7d864210320c617c2f4ce1b60340ab3a8ecee13d5d36b382"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "昭公失常，季女悖狂。遜齊處野，喪其寵光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:19ed93910eb5b53f35c97c2baf8efc96e98479382ce119f608ad93e927e97774",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:acb28a9414d680cf550bbd4c7720a344c9c498983f9a122dcb8f61b08c64bec1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "文山紫芝，雍梁朱草。生長和氣，王以為寶。公尸侑食，福祿來處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f283dcf87d2bb19347c8a4bbf21bf3f3ff143cbed593458d4865beb2fcc686f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2117f400e95e63dfbc42334e991f9f0730c0a0921af078be2b697ade68b0b6cd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "牽羊不前，與心戾旋。聞言不信，誤紿丈人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:db533b6e298b5c3bfe935e61baad93ededed89dc6c1697e277267aab4aa734fa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fce023f57090c95be22a7c630155076dc76727b64e9f0be93faba1e17d930fa9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "東山西山，各自止安。心雖相望，竟不同堂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a82f757b762dd7a2bb6e7138a3917343af33e5883f780d13ce05f9b8afab2b61",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:81ecd1b0dba84d6bd7006473a149f2ac0d218bc6f0d3aef3dd374d481babc826"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "鹿求其子，虎廬之里。唐伯李耳，貪不我許。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:594119fe39bd5e55bb7f5eee6cac9d52d75bffaeb33d07a4d804b390dc847718",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1841b8b6318acf0a85bf15645eaa6667f93b6925b99cff7eee0f4d3f944ba054"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 59,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "三虎上山，更相咆哮。心志不親，如仇與怨。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bfc793d71e80bb5cc9717719eee1ceea6d1d086dcefa26b8deed211b6f3626fc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:071bb76a52856f061100cb2dcffec06ec90612774843216b9a9401c78a3d08f5"
    }
  ]
}
